  "bio": "William Webb is renowned for his exceptional skill in the realms of black & gray and realism tattoos. His remarkable precision and attention to detail have distinguished him as a leading artist at Evolution Tattoo Studio in Mantua, New Jersey. Clients and colleagues alike commend William for his unwavering professionalism, ensuring a serene and trust-inspiring experience throughout the tattooing process.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Mantua, New Jersey, United States"
